{"text_id":1,"forms":["The region in question was once inhabited by a<br>famous clan of ninjas.<br><br>Koga, a Fuchsia City Gym Leader in the distant past,<br>and his daughter, Janine, were both members of<br>this clan."],"absolute_byte_offsets":[577],"raw_metadata_u32":[1]}
{"text_id":2,"forms":["On the 8th of this month, an artificial hot spring<br>debuted in Area 7’s communal bath area.<br><br>This hot spring recreates the quality spring water<br>found in Lavaridge Town in the Hoenn region.<br><br>If it proves popular, there are plans to install hot<br>springs in each area."],"absolute_byte_offsets":[774],"raw_metadata_u32":[1]}
{"text_id":3,"forms":["On the 20th of this month, the Celadon Department<br>Store will open its doors with a fresh new look<br>in Area 2!<br><br>Comment from the manager:<br>Our product selection has changed, but we will<br>continue to greet our customers with our usual<br>welcoming care and service."],"absolute_byte_offsets":[1061],"raw_metadata_u32":[1]}
{"text_id":4,"forms":["The internationally acclaimed and award-winning film<br>“Dream: If Only We Could Meet” will finally make its<br>small-screen debut on the 9th of this month.<br><br>They met and went on a journey together in a dream,<br>but when each awoke, the other was nowhere to be<br>found. Was it nothing more than a dream? Perhaps...<br><br>We hope you enjoy this wistful and heartwarming<br>story of Gengar and Mismagius!"],"absolute_byte_offsets":[1340],"raw_metadata_u32":[1]}
{"text_id":5,"forms":["Floating and Bobbing:<br>Drifloon, the Balloon Pokémon<br><br>Do you know the sad yet heartwarming tale of<br>this Pokémon?<br><br>In this issue, we’ll present a newly interpreted<br>retelling of a certain region’s little-known folktale<br>that was passed down through the ages."],"absolute_byte_offsets":[1756],"raw_metadata_u32":[1]}
